    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to be \"messy.\" there is something beautiful about a story that ends at its highest point, right? like a sunset that stays perfect instead of turning into a dark, cold night. isn't there a certain kind of grace in choosing to depart while the light is still bright, rather than waiting for the inevitable decline?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
